!**/src/main/**
!**/src/test/**

### Eclipse / JDT language server ###
# .project is regenerated by the Java language server, which injects a
# <filteredResources> block on every import. This rule only reaches the ones not
# already tracked — 31 are, and gitignore never untracks; those keep drifting
# until they are either reverted or removed from the index deliberately.
.project

